        <p>No Case ilopeless, as failure is simply impossible. As Mrs. W. writes :—" BY ADOPTING YOUR TREAIMENT. MY TROUBLE AND ANXIETY WAS AT AN END WITH- IN TWENTY-FOUR HOURS AFTER FOUR MONTHS OF IJOPItLES:, WRETCHEDNESS AND CONTINUAL DIS- APPOINTMENT, to my intense joy and surprise."</p>
