        <p>_ gennine nrese.ver and beautifier of allina off t ruing grey, and er", is also sold in st olden co•• : and children. Bottles. 3s. .6d.. 7s small. ODONTO is the h. which can be used. a. it ccm, naTedients ;it. whitens tic,. teeth, , and sweetens the brentit 2s. 31 1) Perfumers and tntorts ; ran be scbt</p>
